  "details": "This is a Local only issue. Other people in the world saw the trails behaving as intended.\n\nIn the Great Pug and In A Rubber Room? My trails (one or more) will attempt to stretch back and forth between my avatar root and the trail root. \n\nThis persisted between restarts of VRChat and was isolated to random worlds. Most worlds did not have this issue. \n\nClip of the issue.\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/HuJyOJw.mp4",
